{"id":47324,"ord":36,"n_segments":152,"prev":47323,"next":47325,"doc":{"id":"61125","title":"61125_Teddy Bunn oral history interview","collection":"rutgers","inst":"Rutgers — Institute of Jazz Studies","interviewee":"Theodore Leroy Bunn","interviewer":"","date":"","year":"","source_url":"https://rucore.libraries.rutgers.edu/rutgers-lib/61125/","url":"https://thisismattmiller.github.io/linked-jazz-2026-transcripts/?t=61125"},"chapter":"Spirits of Rhythm and the road in the 1930s","title":"Booking by Nat Nazzara and the Spirits' tour cities","category":"touring_travel","summary":"Nat Nazzara booked the Spirits at the Onyx home base and to Philadelphia, Boston and Washington but not Baltimore or New Jersey.","period":"mid 1930s","year_from":1934,"year_to":1936,"words":247,"start":[58,5],"end":[60,12],"url":"https://thisismattmiller.github.io/linked-jazz-2026-transcripts/?t=61125#s47324","tags":{"places":[{"name":"New York","focus":1,"type":"city"},{"name":"Boston","focus":1,"type":"city"},{"name":"Philadelphia","focus":1,"type":"city"},{"name":"Washington, D.C.","focus":1,"type":"city"},{"name":"Baltimore","focus":0,"type":"city"},{"name":"Trenton","focus":0,"type":"city"},{"name":"New Jersey","focus":0,"type":"state"}],"venues":[{"name":"Onyx Club","focus":1,"city":"New York"}],"bands":[{"name":"Spirits of Rhythm","focus":1,"leader":null}]},"people":[{"name":"Nat Nazzara","qid":null,"n":3}],"story":{"theme":11,"theme_name":"Life on the road: touring bands, buses and one-nighters","community":20,"community_name":"Life on the road: buses, trains and one-nighters","core":true},"blocks":[{"p":58,"b":5,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"So, let me see, we were talking about the Spirits, about being on tour."},{"p":58,"b":6,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Yeah."},{"p":58,"b":7,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Like in the early '30s, '33, '34, '35, in there. Who was doing your booking at that time?"},{"p":58,"b":8,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Huh?"},{"p":58,"b":9,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"How were you getting your gigs? Who was booking you?"},{"p":58,"b":10,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Oh, let me see. Name some agents."},{"p":58,"b":11,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Well, from that -- I meant early."},{"p":58,"b":12,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Back east?"},{"p":58,"b":13,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Back east, yeah. When you were working at the -- you worked at the Onyx steady, right?"},{"p":58,"b":14,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Yeah."},{"p":58,"b":15,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"That was like your home."},{"p":58,"b":16,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Yeah."},{"p":59,"b":0,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Your home gig, right?"},{"p":59,"b":1,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Yeah. Nat Nazzara. (Phonetic)"},{"p":59,"b":2,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Nat Nazzara."},{"p":59,"b":3,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Yeah."},{"p":59,"b":4,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Did he run the club?"},{"p":59,"b":5,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"No. He --"},{"p":59,"b":6,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"He did the booking."},{"p":59,"b":7,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"He did the booking."},{"p":59,"b":8,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"I see. He had his own agency?"},{"p":59,"b":9,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Yeah. He had his own offices."},{"p":59,"b":10,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Uh-huh. And did you go out of the city much? The original Spirits, like around --"},{"p":59,"b":11,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"He booked us a little while, you know. I mean out of the city. But as far as we went was in -- let's see. Nat booked us -- name some of the cities going up your way."},{"p":59,"b":12,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Well, you know, like Boston."},{"p":59,"b":13,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Boston."},{"p":59,"b":14,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Philadelphia."},{"p":59,"b":15,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Philadelphia."},{"p":59,"b":16,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Baltimore."},{"p":59,"b":17,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Baltimore."},{"p":59,"b":18,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Did you go to Baltimore?"},{"p":59,"b":19,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"No."},{"p":59,"b":20,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"No. Just Philly and Boston?"},{"p":60,"b":0,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Just Philly and Boston."},{"p":60,"b":1,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Did you go to D.C.?"},{"p":60,"b":2,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Washington, yeah."},{"p":60,"b":3,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Yeah. How about over to Jersey, was there much work over there?"},{"p":60,"b":4,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"New Jersey, no."},{"p":60,"b":5,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"At that time?"},{"p":60,"b":6,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"No."},{"p":60,"b":7,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Trenton?"},{"p":60,"b":8,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Trenton, no."},{"p":60,"b":9,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"No."},{"p":60,"b":10,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"No parts of Jersey."},{"p":60,"b":11,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Just the big -- Boston, Philly and New York."},{"p":60,"b":12,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Uh-huh."}]}